  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>Zen 字型</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">描述</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">這項清晰銳利的字體將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗。本字體最初為 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包設計，現已公開提供下載！&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字體基於 Yoshimichi Ohira 設計的 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Zen Dots\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zen Dots</a> Google 字型。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字體採用開放字型授權（OFL）發布。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/631/zen-dots-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>螢幕截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/584/163/2022-12-27_03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就購買伺服器，與好友一同遊玩吧！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
